# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Health Hub — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Frontend (VITE_ prefix = exposed to browser bundle) ──────────────────────
# Base path for all API calls. In dev, Vite proxies this to the VPS.
# In production (Cloudflare Pages), this is handled by Pages Functions.
VITE_API_BASE=/api

# Simple API auth token sent as X-Health-Key header.
# Must match the key your VPS FastAPI server expects.
VITE_API_KEY=brody-health-hub-2026

# ── Server-side only (NO VITE_ prefix = never exposed to browser) ─────────────
# Used by:
#   • Vite local-dev middleware (vite.config.ts) for receipt scan + food photo
#   • Cloudflare Pages Functions for all AI endpoints (scan, analyze-food,
#     meals, meal-detail, fridge enrichment cascade)
#
# All AI runs on Google AI Studio's free tier (gemini-2.5-flash). No paid
# credits. ~15 RPM / 1500 RPD per key — plenty for personal use.
#
# LOCAL DEV: add your key here; Vite never bundles it.
# PRODUCTION: set in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Variables and Secrets
#             (Preview AND Production). Name: GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy-your-key-here

# ── Production Cloudflare Pages env vars (set in dashboard, not here) ─────────
# HEALTH_API_KEY  — same value as VITE_API_KEY (used server-side in CF Functions)
# GEMINI_API_KEY  — same key as above (enables AI features in production)
